---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contenido | NeuroFamilia">
  <div class="app-layout">
    <aside class="sidebar glass-card">
      <div class="sidebar-header">
        <a href="/" class="nav-logo">
          <span class="logo-icon">🧠</span>
          <span class="logo-text">NeuroFamilia</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <nav class="sidebar-nav">
        <a href="/app" class="nav-item">
          <span class="nav-icon">📊</span>
          <span>Dashboard</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#contenido" class="nav-item active">
          <span class="nav-icon">📚</span>
          <span>Contenido</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#quizzes" class="nav-item">
          <span class="nav-icon">🧠</span>
          <span>Quizzes</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#progreso" class="nav-item">
          <span class="nav-icon">📈</span>
          <span>Progreso</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#comunidad" class="nav-item">
          <span class="nav-icon">👥</span>
          <span>Comunidad</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#coaching" class="nav-item">
          <span class="nav-icon">🎓</span>
          <span>Coaching</span>
        </a>
      </nav>

      <div class="sidebar-footer">
        <div class="user-info">
          <div class="user-avatar">M</div>
          <div class="user-details">
            <span class="user-name">María González</span>
            <span class="user-plan">Plan Pro</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button class="logout-btn">Cerrar sesión</button>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <main class="main-content">
      <header class="topbar">
        <div class="topbar-left">
          <h1>Contenido educativo 📚</h1>
          <p class="topbar-subtitle">Explorá artículos, guías y recursos para cada etapa</p>
        </div>
        <div class="topbar-right">
          <div class="search-box">
            <span class="search-icon">🔍</span>
            <input type="text" placeholder="Buscar contenido...">
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="content-controls">
        <div class="filter-tabs">
          <button class="filter-tab active">Todos</button>
          <button class="filter-tab">Primera infancia (0-6)</button>
          <button class="filter-tab">Etapa escolar (6-12)</button>
          <button class="filter-tab">Adolescentes (12-18)</button>
        </div>
        <div class="sort-dropdown">
          <select>
            <option>Más recientes</option>
            <option>Más populares</option>
            <option>Más relevantes</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="featured-section">
        <h2>Destacado</h2>
        <div class="featured-card glass-card">
          <div class="featured-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6);">
            <span class="featured-badge">⭐ Destacado</span>
            <span class="featured-age">Todas las edades</span>
          </div>
          <div class="featured-content">
            <h3>Guía completa: Neuroeducación para padres principiantes</h3>
            <p>Todo lo que necesitás saber para empezar a aplicar principios de neurociencia en tu crianza diaria. Desde las bases del desarrollo cerebral hasta estrategias prácticas.</p>
            <div class="featured-meta">
              <span>📖 25 min de lectura</span>
              <span>🧠 Quiz incluido</span>
              <span>📜 Certificado al completar</span>
            </div>
            <a href="#article" class="btn btn-primary">Leer ahora →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="content-section">
        <h2>Primera infancia (0-6 años)</h2>
        <div class="content-grid">
          <div class="content-card glass-card">
            <div class="card-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ec4899, #f43f5e);">
              <span class="card-duration">📖 8 min</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <span class="card-category">Desarrollo emocional</span>
              <h3>El cerebro emocional del niño pequeño</h3>
              <p>Comprendé cómo procesa emociones tu hijo de 0 a 6 años y aprendé a acompañarlo.</p>
              <div class="card-footer">
                <span class="card-difficulty">Básico</span>
                <a href="#article" class="card-link">Leer →</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="content-card glass-card">
            <div class="card-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669);">
              <span class="card-duration">📖 12 min</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <span class="card-category">Apego seguro</span>
              <h3>Construyendo un apego seguro desde el nacimiento</h3>
              <p>Las bases neurológicas del apego y cómo fomentar una conexión segura.</p>
              <div class="card-footer">
                <span class="card-difficulty">Intermedio</span>
                <a href="#article" class="card-link">Leer →</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="content-card glass-card">
            <div class="card-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b, #d97706);">
              <span class="card-duration">📖 6 min</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <span class="card-category">Juego y aprendizaje</span>
              <h3>Por qué el juego es el mejor aprendizaje</h3>
              <p>Cómo el juego libre moldea el cerebro y fomenta habilidades sociales.</p>
              <div class="card-footer">
                <span class="card-difficulty">Básico</span>
                <a href="#article" class="card-link">Leer →</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="content-section">
        <h2>Etapa escolar (6-12 años)</h2>
        <div class="content-grid">
          <div class="content-card glass-card">
            <div class="card-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #1d4ed8);">
              <span class="card-duration">📖 10 min</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <span class="card-category">Regulación emocional</span>
              <h3>Enseñando a regular emociones en la edad escolar</h3>
              <p>Estrategias basadas en evidencia para ayudar a tu hijo a manejar frustraciones.</p>
              <div class="card-footer">
                <span class="card-difficulty">Intermedio</span>
                <a href="#article" class="card-link">Leer →</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="content-card glass-card">
            <div class="card-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #6366f1);">
              <span class="card-duration">📖 15 min</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <span class="card-category">Límites y disciplina</span>
              <h3>Límites sanos: Ni permisivos ni autoritarios</h3>
              <p>El equilibrio perfecto entre firmeza y comprensión según la neurociencia.</p>
              <div class="card-footer">
                <span class="card-difficulty">Intermedio</span>
                <a href="#article" class="card-link">Leer →</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="content-card glass-card">
            <div class="card-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #14b8a6, #0d9488);">
              <span class="card-duration">📖 8 min</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <span class="card-category">Amistades</span>
              <h3>Habilidades sociales: Cómo ayudar a tu hijo a hacer amigos</h3>
              <p>El desarrollo social en la edad escolar y cómo apoyarlo.</p>
              <div class="card-footer">
                <span class="card-difficulty">Básico</span>
                <a href="#article" class="card-link">Leer →</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="content-section">
        <h2>Adolescentes (12-18 años)</h2>
        <div class="content-grid">
          <div class="content-card glass-card">
            <div class="card-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444, #dc2626);">
              <span class="card-duration">📖 12 min</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <span class="card-category">Comunicación</span>
              <h3>Cómo hablar con tu adolescente sin que se cierre</h3>
              <p>Técnicas de comunicación efectiva basadas en neurociencia.</p>
              <div class="card-footer">
                <span class="card-difficulty">Avanzado</span>
                <a href="#article" class="card-link">Leer →</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="content-card glass-card">
            <div class="card-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316, #ea580c);">
              <span class="card-duration">📖 10 min</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <span class="card-category">Identidad</span>
              <h3>La búsqueda de identidad: Una etapa normal</h3>
              <p>Por qué los adolescentes cuestionan todo y cómo acompañarlos.</p>
              <div class="card-footer">
                <span class="card-difficulty">Intermedio</span>
                <a href="#article" class="card-link">Leer →</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="content-card glass-card">
            <div class="card-image" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #64748b, #475569);">
              <span class="card-duration">📖 14 min</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <span class="card-category">Tecnología</span>
              <h3>Uso saludable de tecnología en adolescentes</h3>
              <p>Cómo establecer límites sanos con dispositivos y redes sociales.</p>
              <div class="card-footer">
                <span class="card-difficulty">Avanzado</span>
                <a href="#article" class="card-link">Leer →</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pagination">
        <button class="page-btn" disabled>← Anterior</button>
        <div class="page-numbers">
          <button class="page-num active">1</button>
          <button class="page-num">2</button>
          <button class="page-num">3</button>
          <span class="page-dots">...</span>
          <button class="page-num">12</button>
        </div>
        <button class="page-btn">Siguiente →</button>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .app-layout {
    display: flex;
    min-height: 100vh;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Sidebar */
  .sidebar {
    width: 260px;
    height: 100vh;
    position: fixed;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-radius: 0;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    border-left: none;
    border-top: none;
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .sidebar-header {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
  }

  .nav-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .logo-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .sidebar-nav {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .nav-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .nav-item:hover {
    background: var(--glass-bg-hover);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .nav-item.active {
    background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15);
    color: var(--accent-light);
  }

  .nav-icon {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .sidebar-footer {
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
  }

  .user-info {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .user-avatar {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: white;
  }

  .user-details {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .user-name {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .user-plan {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--accent-light);
  }

  .logout-btn {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.5rem;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .logout-btn:hover {
    background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);
    border-color: var(--danger);
    color: var(--danger);
  }

  /* Main Content */
  .main-content {
    flex: 1;
    margin-left: 260px;
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
  }

  .topbar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .topbar h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .topbar-subtitle {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .topbar-right {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .search-box {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.625rem 1rem;
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    min-width: 280px;
  }

  .search-box input {
    flex: 1;
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    outline: none;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .search-box input::placeholder {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* Content Controls */
  .content-controls {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .filter-tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .filter-tab {
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .filter-tab:hover {
    background: var(--glass-bg-hover);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .filter-tab.active {
    background: var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: white;
  }

  .sort-dropdown select {
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  /* Featured Section */
  .featured-section {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .featured-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .featured-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 400px 1fr;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .featured-image {
    position: relative;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .featured-badge {
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: white;
  }

  .featured-age {
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: white;
  }

  .featured-content {
    padding: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .featured-content h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .featured-content p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .featured-meta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* Content Section */
  .content-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .content-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .content-card {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .card-image {
    height: 120px;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    padding: 0.75rem;
  }

  .card-duration {
    padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: white;
  }

  .card-body {
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .card-category {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--accent-light);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .card-body h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .card-body p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .card-footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .card-difficulty {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .card-link {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--accent-light);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* Pagination */
  .pagination {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
  }

  .page-btn {
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .page-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background: var(--glass-bg-hover);
  }

  .page-btn:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .page-numbers {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .page-num {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .page-num:hover {
    background: var(--glass-bg-hover);
  }

  .page-num.active {
    background: var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: white;
  }

  .page-dots {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .sidebar {
      width: 80px;
    }

    .sidebar-header .logo-text,
    .nav-item span:not(.nav-icon),
    .user-details,
    .logout-btn {
      display: none;
    }

    .nav-item {
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0.75rem;
    }

    .user-info {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .main-content {
      margin-left: 80px;
    }

    .featured-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .featured-image {
      height: 200px;
    }

    .content-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .sidebar {
      display: none;
    }

    .main-content {
      margin-left: 0;
      padding: 1rem;
    }

    .topbar {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .topbar-right {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .search-box {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: auto;
    }

    .content-controls {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .filter-tabs {
      width: 100%;
      overflow-x: auto;
      flex-wrap: nowrap;
      padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .filter-tab {
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .content-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .pagination {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
